    "updated_at": "2020-06-11T06:57:28Z",
    "body": ">  I'm not sure how you detect that fish_mode_prompt is bad, or if this is somehow happening in fish itself?\r\n\r\nI'm sorry, I'm not terribly familiar with all the bits of fish. What do you mean by fish_mode_prompt being bad?\r\n\r\nI just tried to reproduce this in a Docker container based off of Debian Buster and everything worked fine. Then I tried it under native MacOS + fish, and sure enough, the symbol is stuck. Does that mean it's a fish-specific OS issue? A starship-specific OS issue? A version issue (fish in Docker was v3.0.2)? Not clear to me right now--I'll see if I can run some more tests later this week.",
