    "updated_at": "2020-06-18T08:04:11Z",
    "body": "Thanks for the explanation. If I understand correctly, starship relies on the fish_prompt being called to show the mode. That only works if fish_mode_prompt is empty. I have to use fish_mode_prompt because if it *does* print something, I want to print my control sequence first.\r\n\r\nA possible fix would be for me to override fish_mode_prompt only if it's non-empty, and to use fish_prompt otherwise.",
